      "source": "Build an instance of <code>WebsocketClientSpec</code> that reflects the current\nconfiguration. This can be used to check the configured parameters except\nfor sub-protocols which depend on the <a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> that is used\nfor a given upgrade.",
      "translation": "构建一个反映当前配置的 `<code>WebsocketClientSpec</code>` 实例。这可用于检查已配置的所有参数，除了子协议（sub-protocols），后者取决于用于特定升级的 <a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.reactive.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> 接口。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
